This project includes a modified/adapted copy of Classy's Kotlin timetable
parser layer under:
  android/app/src/main/java/com/imsx3d/classy/data/jw/

It is compiled into the Android app and called through
ClassyParserBridge / the com.hsu.hsu_schedule/classy_parser MethodChannel.
The school preset data was transformed into schools/index.json.
The zf_new fallback was ported to Dart in lib/classy_parser.dart.

Modifications: package/application integration, a Flutter MethodChannel
bridge, conversion from Classy JwCourse records to this app's timetable HTML,
and removal of unused Compose/ViewModel/database code. No Compose UI code
was copied.

